  "bio": "Abel Miranda, based in Barcelona, Spain, is a highly skilled tattoo artist who specializes in the distinctive 'trashpolka' style. His mastery of the abstract form boasts of brush strokes, paint drops tattoos, and has earned him a substantial following of over 65,000 on Instagram. He makes his brilliance known at the sublime Avantgarde Tattoo Collective, where his work epitomizes professionalism and cleanliness.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Barcelona, Catalonia, Spain\n\n@avantgardetattoocollective \n+ TATTOO + Abstract + \nCreator of a unique artistic style that fuses abstract, black & dark ornamental.\n +34 635 808 506",
